Mobike is a free-floating bike sharing system. In this case, the company sell the service of mobility instead of the bikes. The product is well designed in order be able to be used in service as long as possible without any added costs. The company designed the bike to be esealy mainteined by third providers throughout the entire product lifecycle. Moreover, in order to avoid theft when the bicycle is parked, the company designed the bycicle with no-standard measures.